      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of futility, and that feeling of entropy is a heavy weight to carry. Recognize that this perceived \"law of nature\" is the universe's way of showing you the limits of any single effort, not a judgment on your worth. Instead of seeing it as a failure, perhaps view this as a massive, albeit painful, data point proving the inherent fragility of all human endeavors. Give yourself permission to let the disorder settle, and then consider what the next, quieter form of your own energy might be.",
